":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏将。作为随从与曹叡狩猎时，徒手搏杀猛虎解救曹叡。诸葛亮北伐期间，为曹真部将，曹真的指挥下多次抵御诸葛亮的进攻。","tc":"魏將。作為隨從與曹叡狩獵時，徒手搏殺猛虎解救曹叡。諸葛亮北伐期間，為曹真部將，曹真的指揮下多次抵御諸葛亮的進攻。","en":"Officer of Wei. While hunting with Emperor Cao Rui as an attendant, he killed a tiger with his bare hands to rescue Cao Rui. During Zhuge Liang's Northern Expeditions, he served as a subordinate general under Cao Zhen and, under Cao Zhen's command, repeatedly repelled Zhuge Liang's attacks.","jp":"魏の将。曹叡の狩猟に随行した際、素手で猛虎を討ち取って曹叡を救出した。諸葛亮の北伐の際は曹真の部将を務め、曹真の指揮下で諸葛亮の進攻を幾度も防ぎ止めた。","kr":"위나라의 장수. 조예를 수행하여 사냥하던 중 맨손으로 맹호를 격살하여 조예를 구출했다. 제갈량의 북벌 당시 조진의 부장으로서 그의 지휘 아래 제갈량의 침공을 여러 차례 막아냈다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10408","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"礼","nameTc":"禮","nameEn":"Li","nameJp":"礼","nameKr":"례","nameOther":"","word":"德达","wordTc":"德達","wordEn":"Deda","wordJp":"徳達","wordKr":"덕달","wordOther":"","icon":"孙礼","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"204","city":"CS1010","gender":"0","rule":"78","force":"81","wise":"67","politics":"73","charm":"31","will":"31","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"2","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"27/27/27/80/27/18/50/27","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1004802;1000205","battleSkill":"1003002;1002002","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"6500","debateSoulPoint":"4400","strategy":"1002908","strategy2":"","professions":"3/2/3/0/2/0/3/0/1/0/0/0/4/0/5/0/0/0/2/2/0/0/0/3","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"13","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2700","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"180","